	"data": "Service: AnythingLLM\n\n⛔ DEPRECATED — 2026-04-20\nAnythingLLM has been replaced by the Custom RAG pipeline (Qdrant + BM25 on [[infra/star]]).\nThe kb.cybernautics.net Caddy route has been removed.\nContainers (anythingllm, chromadb) still exist on [[infra/optiplex]] but are no longer in use.\nDecommission: ssh optiplex 'docker stop anythingllm chromadb && docker rm anythingllm chromadb'\nData volumes: /mnt/storage/anythingllm and /mnt/storage/chromadb can be archived or deleted.\nSee [[infra/star]]…",
